+// running without a session manager, a sound server with no output, WASAPI refusing the endpoint while
+// DirectSound takes it). Not when SDL_AUDIO_DRIVER is set (that driver was chosen), and only while this driver is
+// SDL's only audio user (SDL_QuitSubSystem must really stop it). Called with stream_mutex_ held.
